cloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-195"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Q39Q0GxxHCw","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Willie Hutch - Mack's Stroll","track":{"id":"-I1Ru70RXvQ","path":"/artists/willie-hutch/tracks/mack-s-stroll/","slug":"macks-stroll","title":"Mack's Stroll","artist":{"slug":"willie-hutch","title":"Willie Hutch"},"artwork":"images/artists/willie-hutch/tracks/mack-s-stroll.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"e4aIJzfSC6o","slug":"256","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-256/ra.1105607925","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-256-live-from-sydney-australia"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #256 (Live From Sydney, Australia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/256.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7208,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-04-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"Nq4rpX8MKIs","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Willie Hutch - I Choose You (Soundtrack/The Mack)","trac